@startuml
' Discivium system sequence for assignment submission

title Discivium - System Sequence: Submit Assignment File
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

actor Student
boundary "Discivium system" as System

Student -> System: viewPublishedAssignment(assignmentId)
System --> Student: assignment details and submission form

Student -> System: submitAssignmentFile(assignmentId, file)
alt Request is authorized and file is valid
  System --> Student: submission confirmation
else Request is unauthorized or file is invalid
  System --> Student: safe error response
end

Student -> System: viewOwnSubmission(assignmentId)
System --> Student: submission status and file metadata
@enduml
